      (property "Description" "MX hot-swap socket, vendor SMT on the bottom side. COUNT / POWER: closes SYS to PWR_KEY, powering the board on and, through Q5, driving COUNT_N low. The user presses a clicky MX switch (CPG151101D13, clipped into the printed key plate) into it: no switch soldering." (at 294.64 238.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
